@startuml
!include act_style.iuml
|User|
|GitHub Sign-In|
|CheckedIn System|
|Brevo Email API|
|User|
start
:Open CheckedIn sign-in page;
if (Sign-in method?) then (GitHub)
  |GitHub Sign-In|
  :Sign in to GitHub,
  approve CheckedIn;
  |CheckedIn System|
  :Exchange GitHub's one-time code
  for a token (server side), then
  get the account's email list;
  if (State matches and a\nverified @cit.edu email?) then (no)
    :Show "Please use your
    CIT-U email address";
    stop
  else (yes)
  endif
else (Email code)
  |User|
  :Enter @cit.edu email and
  click "Send code";
  |CheckedIn System|
  if (Email ends in @cit.edu and\nfewer than 3 codes in 15 min?) then (no)
    :Show error message;
    stop
  else (yes)
  endif
  :Create 6-digit code; save only its hash
  with a 10-minute expiry;
  |Brevo Email API|
  :Send code to the user's inbox;
  |User|
  :Type the code from the email;
  |CheckedIn System|
  if (Code matches, not expired,\nnot used, under 5 wrong tries?) then (no)
    :Count wrong try and
    show error message;
    stop
  else (yes)
  endif
  :Mark code as used;
endif
if (Account exists?) then (no)
  :Create user account;
  if (Email on professor list?) then (yes)
    :Set role = PROFESSOR;
  else (no)
    :Set role = STUDENT;
  endif
  |User|
  :Enter first and last name;
  |CheckedIn System|
else (yes)
  :Update last login time;
endif
if (Student without student ID?) then (yes)
  |User|
  :Enter student ID;
  |CheckedIn System|
  :Check format 00-0000-000 and
  that no other account uses it;
  :Link all enrollments with
  the same ID;
  :Flag enrollments whose last
  name does not match;
else (no)
endif
:Start session (HttpOnly cookie, 8 h);
:Open Professor or Student dashboard;
|User|
stop
@enduml
